{'symbol': 'FIS', 'date': '2021-09-14 08:00:00', 'title': 'CHARTIS NAMES FIS AS CATEGORY LEADER FOR ENERGY TRADING AND RISK MANAGEMENT SOLUTIONS', 'text': "JACKSONVILLE, FLA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FINANCIAL TECHNOLOGY LEADER FIS® (NYSE: FIS) HAS BEEN NAMED A CATEGORY LEADER FOR ITS ENERGY TRADING AND RISK MANAGEMENT SOLUTIONS BY LEADING INDUSTRY RESEARCH HOUSE CHARTIS RESEARCH. CHARTIS PLACED FIS AS A “CATEGORY LEADER” IN ITS NEW REPORT, “ENERGY RISK: ETRM SYSTEMS, 2021; MARKET UPDATE AND VENDOR LANDSCAPE.” VENDORS ARE ASSESSED ACCORDING TO THE COMPLETENESS OF THEIR OFFERINGS AS WELL AS THEIR MARKET POTENTIAL. FIS' SOLUTIONS WERE RECOGNIZED AS BEST-IN"}